  "method": [
    "Frozen private GrandAngle catalogue from 2026-10-22; warmed production container and persistent Markdown pool; fresh static output per run. No production configuration or data changed.",
    "The baseline already includes the previous native analyzer/minifier fixes. Both modes use PHP Markdown, the same native analyzer/minifier binaries and four workers pinned to CPUs 2-5.",
    "The isolated benchmark fixes the per-page PRNG seed, as in the previous report. Only private static-root paths in .Caddyfile are normalized for comparison. All other file bytes and symlink targets are checked.",
    "Baseline autoloads saved unmodified PageRepository, TaxonomyProductCountService and TaxonomyProductTwigExtension sources; optimized mode uses the unjoined aggregate, the covering index and filtered catalogue hydration. Neither mode memoizes corpus fingerprints.",
    "Two successful default-quality builds per mode. The final optimized repeat also includes the extended-page inheritance guard. The frozen catalogue has no extended pages; a functional fixture tests that behavior separately.",
    "Full-build times are observations on a shared workstation, not a production SLA or statistically isolated causal estimate.",
    "Raw SQLite timings execute the two SQL shapes on separate copies of the same database: seven alternating repetitions of 200 queries per mode, checking every returned tuple against the baseline.",
    "Compression quality experiments are private benchmark-only changes. The shipped default remains Brotli quality 11.",
    "Rejected trials are excluded from successful-build statistics: request-local memoization was stale after same-request unpublication; an index without ID second changed implicit row order; an output that ran out of temporary storage was incomplete; one repeat accidentally copied unrelated newer Product API accesses into the older frozen model, emitted warnings and is excluded."
